# Vercel Hobby: owner must push

This site deploys on **Vercel Hobby (free)**. Hobby only builds commits pushed by the GitHub account that owns the Vercel project (`williammgyasii`). Cursor Agent / bot pushes are skipped or billed. Do not upgrade the plan to work around this.

## Do

- Edit locally in `Personal-Website/`
- Commit with the user's git identity when they ask to commit
- Ship only with the **local git CLI** (`git commit`, `git push`)
- Push only after they say to push **and** `gh api user --jq .login` is `williammgyasii`

## Do not

- Use Cursor Agent / cloud agent / GitHub App to push or "ship" this repo
- Use Cursor's hosted GitHub shipping flow
- `git push` if `gh` is logged in as `wgyasi` or any account other than `williammgyasii`
- Suggest Vercel Pro or a team plan as the fix

## Check before any website push

```bash
gh api user --jq .login   # must be williammgyasii
```
